  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "永續融資 - 找錢大作戰",
    "sub_ename": "PERPETUAL FINANCING - BIG FUND CHALLENG",
    "describe_ch": "永續融資目的在於運用網路對大眾的可及性，尋求對新創企業的融資。 「永續融資-找錢大作戰」之課程，是以群眾募資理論、搭配實務個案，以及資訊蒐集分析的結合，以培養學生未來創業能力。課程規劃將分析成功的募資案例，並說明群眾募資的風險，以增進學生未來籌資成功的可能性。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to make use of the easy accessibility of vast networks of people to finance a new business venture. The course of \"Big fund challenge _ Crowdfunding” is based on the principle of public crowdfunding combined with big data analysis to help cultivate entrepreneurship. The lessons will also analyze the key factors of successful campaigns and risks of taking advantage of crowdfunding in order to enhance students’ future chances of success.",
